governor turn 1: plan -> watchlist-store, watchlist  ("Make the watchlist easier to use" translated into three concrete, testable usability wins on the watchlist screen: filter the list by status (all / still to watch / watched), an A–Z title sort toggle, and a one-click "clear watched" bulk action. The bulk action needs one new store method (clearWatched), the rest is additive component work with screen-reader announcements via the existing announcement signal. No existing behaviour or tests change.)
